# Migration Checklist: Supabase -> Convex

## Code Conversion Reference

### Imports to Replace

```typescript
// REMOVE these imports
import { createClient } from "@/lib/supabase/server";
import { createClient } from "@/lib/supabase/client";
import { adminClient } from "@/lib/supabase/admin";
import { Tables } from "@/db/supabase/database.types";

// REPLACE with
import { useQuery, useMutation } from "convex/react";
import { api } from "@/convex/_generated/api";
import { Doc, Id } from "@/convex/_generated/dataModel";
```

### Type Conversions

| Supabase | Convex |
|---|---|
| `Tables<"games">` | `Doc<"games">` |
| `Tables<"game_players">` | `Doc<"gamePlayers">` |
| `Tables<"game_sessions">` | `Doc<"gameSessions">` |
| `Tables<"join_requests">` | `Doc<"joinRequests">` |
| `Tables<"night_phase_sessions">` | `Doc<"nightPhaseSessions">` |
| `Tables<"voting_sessions">` | `Doc<"votingSessions">` |
| `Tables<"votes">` | `Doc<"votes">` |
| `Tables<"game_player_roles">` | `Doc<"gamePlayerRoles">` |
| `Tables<"game_spectators">` | `Doc<"gameSpectators">` |
| `Tables<"profiles">` | `Doc<"profiles">` |
| `string` (UUID) | `Id<"games">`, `Id<"users">`, etc. |

