### Database Operation Conversions

```typescript
// SELECT single
// Old: await supabase.from("games").select("*").eq("id", gameId).single()
// New:
await ctx.db.get(gameId);

// SELECT with filter
// Old: await adminClient.from("game_players").select("*").eq("game_id", gameId)
// New:
await ctx.db.query("gamePlayers").withIndex("by_gameId", q => q.eq("gameId", gameId)).collect();

// INSERT
// Old: await adminClient.from("game_sessions").insert({ game_id: gameId, ... })
// New:
await ctx.db.insert("gameSessions", { gameId, ... });

// UPDATE
// Old: await adminClient.from("games").update({ game_status: "playing" }).eq("id", gameId)
// New:
await ctx.db.patch(gameId, { gameStatus: "playing" });

// DELETE
// Old: await adminClient.from("join_requests").delete().eq("id", requestId)
// New:
await ctx.db.delete(requestId);
```

### Server Action -> Mutation Conversion

```typescript
// Old: "use server" function called directly
// src/lib/gameRoom/actions.ts
"use server";
export async function createGameRoom(input) {
  const supabase = await createClient();
  const { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser();
  // ...
}

// New: Convex mutation called via useMutation
// convex/games.ts
export const create = mutation({
  args: { name: v.string(), type: v.string() },
  handler: async (ctx, args) => {
    const userId = await getAuthUserId(ctx);
    // ...
  },
});

// Frontend:
const createGame = useMutation(api.games.create);
await createGame({ name: "My Game", type: "japanese_mafia" });
```

## Files to DELETE After Full Migration

- `src/lib/supabase/` (entire folder)
- `src/db/supabase/` (entire folder)
- `src/hooks/realtime/` (entire folder)
- `src/lib/auth/actions.ts` (replaced by Convex auth)
- `src/app/api/auth/confirm/route.ts` (replaced by Convex OTP)
- All `"use server"` action files in `src/lib/*/actions.ts` (replaced by `convex/*.ts`)

## Files to KEEP (unchanged or minimal changes)

- `src/lib/constants/game.ts` (game constants)
- `src/lib/game/visibility.ts` (pure visibility logic)
- `src/lib/utils/` (utility functions)
- `src/lib/liveKit/messageTypes.ts` (LiveKit message types)
- `src/components/ui/` (UI primitives)
- `src/hooks/livekit/` (LiveKit hooks - mostly unchanged)
- `src/hooks/participant/` (participant hooks - mostly unchanged)

## Verification After Each Migration Phase

1. Run `npx convex dev` to verify schema and functions deploy
2. Run `npx tsc` to verify TypeScript compiles
3. Test the migrated feature in the browser
4. Verify real-time updates work (change data, confirm UI updates)
